{
  "id": "commerce-chat-real-regression-v3",
  "split": "regression",
  "conversations": [
    {
      "id": "mcd-real-sealed-v3",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "想去上海人民广场这边的麦当劳吃点东西。先找附近还在营业的，挑最近的店查下菜单。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.search_stores",
              "commerce.menu"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "牛肉汉堡的套餐你替我挑一款在售的，一份原装搭配就行，我坐店里吃。先把总价和单子给我核对，暂时不要提交。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "proposed"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.prepare_order"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "awaiting_confirmation"
            ],
            "cart_quantities": [
              1
            ],
            "take_way_title": "堂食"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "刚才这份还是打包拿走吧，别的别改，也先别下单，再出个预览。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "proposed"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.revise_order"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "awaiting_confirmation"
            ],
            "cart_quantities": [
              1
            ],
            "take_way_title": "外带",
            "same_checkout_as_turn": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "我不点了，撤掉刚刚这个草稿。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.cancel_checkout"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "cancelled"
            ],
            "same_checkout_as_turn": 2
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}